  "description": {
   "value": "<p>Starting at 10th level, your focus can keep you fighting despite grievous wounds. If you drop to 0 hit points while you're focused and don't die outright, you can make a DC 10 Constitution saving throw. If you succeed, you drop to 1 hit point instead. </p>\n<p>Each time you use this feature after the first, the DC increases by 5. When you finish a short or long rest, the DC resets to 10.</p>",
